  "title": "Gaussian Process \u2014 Trend + Seasonality",
  "description": "A Linear kernel (the trend) plus a Periodic kernel (the season), learned from noisy data. The plot shows the predictive mean and its 95% band: the fit extrapolates the pattern beyond the data and the band widens where there is no data. Swap the Sum for a single RBF kernel to see why the kernel matters."
 },
